{"id":"exce_s","lemma":"excès","pos":"noun","rank":4355,"glosses":["excess"],"ipa":"/ɛk.sɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/Fr-exc%C3%A8s.ogg/Fr-exc%C3%A8s.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Il n'est pas bon de manger en excès.","en":"It's not good to overeat.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Mon ami a été arrêté pour excès de vitesse.","en":"My friend was arrested for speeding.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"speed"}]},{"text":"L'excès de politesse est ennuyeux.","en":"Excess of politeness is annoying.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"politeness, courtesy"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"dull"}]},{"text":"J'ai péché par excès de confiance.","en":"I was overconfident.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"sin"},{"g":"through"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"trustworthy, reliable"]]},{"text":"Autant pécher par excès de prudence.","en":"Better to err on the side of caution.","words":[{"g":"so much"},{"g":"to sin"},{"g":"through"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"prudence"}]}]}